ain\' set up to track remote branch \'main\' from \'origin\'.','success','2026-08-04 16:39:44'),(10,5,'1','7635b40','Actualización de 1 v1','Reinitialized existing Git repository in /var/www/html/VILASECA/CMDBPRnew/public/femsa/repository/.git/\n[main 7635b40] Actualización de 1 v1\n 3 files changed, 31 insertions(+)\n create mode 100755 1/1\n create mode 100755 1/1.md\n create mode 100755 1/README.md\nTo https://github.com/blacic2016/femsa-sonda.git\n   1bf78f2..7635b40  main -> main\nBranch \'main\' set up to track remote branch \'main\' from \'origin\'.','success','2026-08-04 16:48:29'),(11,5,'1','5d07151','Actualización de 1 v1','Reinitialized existing Git repository in /var/www/html/VILASECA/CMDBPRnew/public/femsa/repository/.git/\n[main 5d07151] Actualización de 1 v1\n 2 files changed, 2 insertions(+), 2 deletions(-)\nTo https://github.com/blacic2016/femsa-sonda.git\n   7635b40..5d07151  main -> main\nBranch \'main\' set up to track remote branch \'main\' from \'origin\'.','success','2026-08-04 16:48:33'),(12,3,'GPF_TOTEM_TOTAL','ace9bfa','Actualización de GPF_TOTEM_TOTAL v4','Reinitialized existing Git repository in /var/www/html/PROYECTOSONDA/PREPODUCCION/CMDBPRnew/public/femsa/repository/.git/\n[main ace9bfa] Actualización de GPF_TOTEM_TOTAL v4\n 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+), 1 deletion(-)\nTo https://github.com/blacic2016/femsa-sonda.git\n   5d07151..ace9bfa  main -> main\nBranch \'main\' set up to track remote branch \'main\' from \'origin\'.','success','2026-08-24 21:34:57'),(13,3,'GPF_TOTEM_TOTAL','ace9bfa','Actualización de GPF_TOTEM_TOTAL v4','Reinitialized existing Git repository in /var/www/html/PROYECTOSONDA/PREPODUCCION/CMDBPRnew/public/femsa/repository/.git/\nOn branch main\nYour branch is up to date with \'origin/main\'.\n\nnothing to commit, working tree clean\nEverything up-to-date\nBranch \'main\' set up to track remote branch \'main\' from \'origin\'.','success','2026-08-24 21:34:59');
