onda ','SONDA0001A','Servicios Internos de Sonda','Bajo demanda','14 may 2026','16:29','16:48','0:19','0:19','','','1:00',11),(1682,'366','RF-8676227','Estimados,_x000d_\n_x000d_\nPor favor su ayuda con la evaluación y los pasos a seguir sobre las siguientes vulnerabilidades que han sido reportadas para los ambientes Cisco SDWAN._x000d_\n_x000d_\nD-WAN Security Issue Impacting On-Premises Customers_x000d_\n_x000d_\nDear Valued Cisco SD-WAN Customer,On May 14, 2026 at 9:00 AM PST, Cisco\'s Product Security Incident Response Team (PSIRT) published two advisories regarding critical vulnerabilities affecting specific Cisco Catalyst SD-WAN software releases.We strongly urge that you upgrade to a recommended fixed release as soon as possible to protect the security and integrity of your network. These upgrades address important security issues and help safeguard your environment from potential threats._x000d_\n_x000d_\nNext Steps_x000d_\n_x000d_\nReview Advisories: Please review the details outlined in the two advisories:_x000d_\n_x000d_\nCisco Catalyst SD-WAN Controller Authentication Bypass Vulnerability_x000d_\n_x000d_\nCisco Catalyst SD-WAN Vulnerabilities_x000d_\n_x000d_\n _x000d_\n_x000d_\nUpgrade: If you are currently running an affected version, follow the guidance in the advisories and upgrade to the recommended fixed release. It is best practice to generate and save admin-tech logs from all SD-WAN control components prior to the upgrade to prevent diagnostic data from getting lost._x000d_\n_x000d_\nContact Support: If you need assistance or have questions about your specific fabric(s), please submit a service request with the Technical Assistance Center (TAC). If you are utilizing a managed service provider, please reach out directly to confirm that the upgrade is scheduled and completed._x000d_\n_x000d_\nThank you for your prompt attention to this critical security matter.','Santiago Santacruz Basantes','ANDES PETROLEUM ECUADOR LTD.','SDWAN','NA44','PSS ','Bajo demanda','','','','','','','','',11),(1683,'368','Sesión - Reunión - 368','Dayli Redes_x000d_\n_x000d_\n_x000d_\nSeguimiento de casos en general.','José Jibaja Robles','SONDA ECUADOR','Tareas internas de  Sonda ','SONDA0001A','Servicios Internos de Sonda','Bajo demanda','15 may 2026','08:58','09:35','0:36','0:36','','','1:00',11),(1684,'368','Sesión - Reunión - 368','Dayli Redes_x000d_\n_x000d_\n_x000d_\nSeguimiento de casos en general.','José Jibaja Robles','SONDA ECUADOR','Tareas internas de  Sonda ','SONDA0001A','Servicios Internos de Sonda','Bajo demanda','15 may 2026','16:51','16:51','0:00','0:00','','','1:00',11),(1685,'370','RF-7446275','Viernes 15 de mayo_x000d_\n_x000d_\nVentana de Actualización 18:00_x000d_\n_x000d_\nSegún lo acordado los servidores a actualizar serán Expressway Core, Expressway Edge y UCCX','José Jibaja Robles','ANDES PETROLEUM ECUADOR LTD.','ACTUALIZACIÓN DE LA PLATAFORMA DE COMUNICACIONES UNIFICADAS OC-3107','NA84','Horas de Soporte','Por Contrato','15 may 2026','18:00','00:11','6:10','','','6:10','14:00',11),(1686,'374','Implementación - 374','Estimados,_x000d_\nSu ayuda validando la política de fw que permite acceso a Keyla Suarez desde Guayaquil al servicio Moebuis (10.151.140.50/32) que está en Chile._x000d_\n _x000d_\nMOEBIUS_x000d_\n _x000d_\n _x000d_\n _x000d_\nOscar Zambrano_x000d_\nLíder Informática Interna_x000d_\nCel: +593 992010361','Kevin Plazarte Falcon','SONDA ECUADOR','Servicios gestionados','SONDA001B','Servicios Internos de Sonda','Bajo demanda','18 may 2026','11:04','10:26','23:21','9:21','14:00','','37:30',11),(1687,'374','Implementación - 374','Estimados,_x000d_\nSu ayuda validando la política de fw que permite acceso a Keyla Suarez desde Guayaquil al servicio Moebuis (10.151.140.50/32) que está en Chile._x000d_\n _x000d_\nMOEBIUS_x000d_\n _x000d_\n _x000d_\n _x000d_\nOscar Zambrano_x000d_\nLíder Informática Interna_x000d_\nCel: +593 992010361','Kevin Plazarte Falcon','SONDA ECUADOR','Servicios gestionados','SONDA0